</blockquote> 
<blockquote id="blockquote_38">20. 	That, petitioner admitted in his letter dated 16.03.2013 that he is ready to get connection without having NOC from pollution control Board. It proves that power corporation has bifurcated 33 KVA line, laid a separate 33 KV line constructed 4 pole structure. Copy of letter dated 16.03.2016 of petitioner to Executive Engineer is being filed herewith as ANNEXURE NO.SCA-3 to this affidavit.&quot;
</blockquote> 
